   "source": [
    "# 10 — Decision Policy V2 · Closed Loop\n",
    "## `bd_replica_crm` — policy real → experimento → recomendación → acción → outcome → aprendizaje\n",
    "\n",
    "La V1 encontró el gap correcto:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Evidence           206,043\n",
    "Scores               2,017\n",
    "Recommendations       2,017\n",
    "Actions                   0\n",
    "Outcomes                113\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "y además mostró que un threshold fijo `priority_score >= 70` no era compatible\n",
    "con la escala real del score.\n",
    "\n",
    "La V2 cambia el contrato operativo:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "SERVING SCORE\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "ELEGIBILITY\n",
    "LIVE + PENDING + vigente\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "BAND / RANK POLICY\n",
    "A primero → B después\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "CAPACITY\n",
    "máximo diario\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "DETERMINISTIC ASSIGNMENT\n",
    "Treatment / Control\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "Treatment → RECOMMENDATION\n",
    "Control   → business as usual\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "HUMAN ACTION\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "SLA / ADOPTION\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "OUTCOME\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "CAUSAL READINESS\n",
    "     ↓\n",
    "LEARNING / POLICY UPDATE\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Cambios frente a V1\n",
    "\n",
    "- elimina el threshold absoluto arbitrario;\n",
    "- usa bandas + ranking + capacidad;\n",
    "- separa recomendaciones V2 de las recomendaciones legacy;\n",
    "- asigna treatment/control de forma reproducible;\n",
    "- solo **treatment** materializa una recomendación operativa;\n",
    "- conserva human-in-the-loop;\n",
    "- no contacta automáticamente a nadie;\n",
    "- no borra ni modifica recomendaciones legacy.\n"
   ]
  },
