    "## 28. Recomendación operativa de uso\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fase A — DRY RUN\n",
    "\n",
    "Mantener:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "WRITE_MODE=False\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Ejecutar completo y verificar:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `Gate 0`;\n",
    "- distribución real de bandas/scores;\n",
    "- elegibilidad;\n",
    "- candidatos seleccionados;\n",
    "- Treatment/Control;\n",
    "- balance;\n",
    "- `Gate 1`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fase B — crear piloto\n",
    "\n",
    "Solo cuando Gate 1 esté PASS:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "WRITE_MODE=True\n",
    "CREATE_EXPERIMENT=True\n",
    "WRITE_ASSIGNMENTS=True\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Ejecutar hasta assignments.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fase C — materializar recomendaciones\n",
    "\n",
    "Después:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "WRITE_RECOMMENDATIONS=True\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Solo Treatment genera recommendation.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fase D — adopción humana\n",
    "\n",
    "Elegir una recomendación real y registrar la acción:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "SELECTED_RECOMMENDATION_ID=\"...\"\n",
    "REGISTER_ONE_ACTION=True\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Fase E — outcomes\n",
    "\n",
    "Cuando existan labels maduros:\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "REFRESH_MATURED_OUTCOMES=True\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Nunca convertir automáticamente una diferencia observada en efecto causal.\n"
   ]
  },
